(7645258, 1242769, 5628, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot! The cliffs on the left really help create a sense of perspective. Good Job!</td>', 'Very nice shot! The cliffs on the left really help create a sense of perspective. Good Job!', '2019-11-04 03:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7645259, 1242788, 5628, '<td valign="top">I love this! Very interesting image.</td>', 'I love this! Very interesting image.', '2019-11-04 03:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7645260, 1242789, 5628, '<td valign="top">I love the tone of this image. It tells a story. Good job!</td>', 'I love the tone of this image. It tells a story. Good job!', '2019-11-04 03:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7645261, 1242776, 5628, '<td valign="top">I like your idea and I think this has the potential to be a great image. The background is a bit too bright. I think it would really make the image pop, if you could tone that down a bit.</td>', 'I like your idea and I think this has the potential to be a great image. The background is a bit too bright. I think it would really make the image pop, if you could tone that down a bit.', '2019-11-04 03:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7645262, 1242487, 5628, '<td valign="top">I like how this image tells a story. A moment in the lives of these people. Its a little bit on the dark side and I feel providing a specific focal point would make the image even better.</td>', 'I like how this image tells a story. A moment in the lives of these people. Its a little bit on the dark side and I feel providing a specific focal point would make the image even better.', '2019-11-04 03:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7645263, 1242743, 5628, '<td valign="top">I love this! My favorite image in the challenge. I like how the lines of the cliffs draw your attention to the center of the image.</td>', 'I love this! My favorite image in the challenge. I like how the lines of the cliffs draw your attention to the center of the image.', '2019-11-04 04:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7645264, 1242517, 5628, '<td valign="top">I think a closer crop on the yellow rope would have worked better here. The composition is very busy, especially with the grating, which is a very distracting element.</td>', 'I think a closer crop on the yellow rope would have worked better here. The composition is very busy, especially with the grating, which is a very distracting element.', '2019-11-04 04:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7645265, 1242416, 5628, '<td valign="top">The main reason I dont buy stuff from Ikea! <br/> <br/>This image is very busy and the light in the bottom left is distracting. Overall, I think the composition would have benefitted from a closer crop on the cabinet.</td>', 'The main reason I dont buy stuff from Ikea!  This image is very busy and the light in the bottom left is distracting. Overall, I think the composition would have benefitted from a closer crop on the cabinet.', '2019-11-04 04:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7645266, 1242800, 5628, '<td valign="top">I like the colors of the leaves, but the lighting is very flat. The image lacks depth, or something which would draw the attention to the subject.</td>', 'I like the colors of the leaves, but the lighting is very flat. The image lacks depth, or something which would draw the attention to the subject.', '2019-11-04 04:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7645267, 1242733, 5628, '<td valign="top">I like the different textures created by the leaves and pine needles. The colors are a little dull though. I think that this image could be greatly improved by playing with the levels to make the colors stand out more.</td>', 'I like the different textures created by the leaves and pine needles. The colors are a little dull though. I think that this image could be greatly improved by playing with the levels to make the colors stand out more.', '2019-11-04 04:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7645268, 1242792, 5628, '<td valign="top">I generally like these types of city night shots, Did you add some sort of  overlay?  I feel it detracts from the overall image.</td>', 'I generally like these types of city night shots, Did you add some sort of  overlay?  I feel it detracts from the overall image.', '2019-11-04 04:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7645269, 1242791, 5628, '<td valign="top">I like the texture of the asphalt. Im guessing the title is related to the little brownish bit (is that a maple seed) at the top? If so, I feel it needs to feature more prominently in the image. Perhaps something to draw the viewers attention to your subject would help.</td>', 'I like the texture of the asphalt. Im guessing the title is related to the little brownish bit (is that a maple seed) at the top? If so, I feel it needs to feature more prominently in the image. Perhaps something to draw the viewers attention to your subject would help.', '2019-11-04 04:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
